  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of RAHU&#x2019;s media work to advance youth-centered SRHR narratives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reach A Hand Uganda (RAHU) uses health communication and the media to advance young people&#x2019;s livelihoods and sexual and reproductive health and rights in Uganda. This grant will enable RAHU to deepen its work under the SautiPlus Media Hub and promote narrative change through the creative arts that supports young people&#x2019;s agency in making informed life choices. (Strategy: Global Reproductive Equity)</narrative>
  </description>
